"what":"第三次中期股息派发日","what_en":"Payment date for third interim dividend","ann":"11699977","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11699977","src":"ai"}],"recent_en":"UMSINT suspended trading in late September 2026 and subsequently announced a placement of up to 52,941,100 new shares at RM8.50 each to raise about RM450m for expansion in Penang, Vietnam and Singapore. The placement was completed on 9 October and the new shares were listed on 12 October. The company also declared a third interim dividend of 1.0 Singapore cent per share.","notable_en":["Completed placement of 52,941,100 new shares at RM8.50 each, raising about RM450m.","New shares were listed and quoted on Bursa and SGX on 12 October 2026.","Declared a third interim dividend of 1.0 Singapore cent per share (equivalent to MYR 0.0318)."],"risks_en":["The placement shares represent approximately 5.96% of the enlarged share capital, diluting existing shareholders' stakes.","The company requested a trading suspension on 29 September 2026 pending an announcement, and trading resumed the same day."],"earnings_en":""}